{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: NoticeList.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport NoticeRow from \"./NoticeRow\";\nimport { fetchNotices } from \"../api/noticeApi\";\nimport { formatDate } from \"../utils/date\";\nimport { PAGE_SIZE } from \"../constants/board\";\nimport \"./NoticeList.css\";\n\nfunction NoticeList({ category, onSelect }) {\n  const [notices, setNotices] = useState([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    fetchNotices(category, PAGE_SIZE).then((rows) => {\n      setNotices(rows);\n      setLoading(false);\n    });\n  }, [category]);\n\n  if (loading) return <p className=\"loading\">불러오는 중...</p>;\n  return (\n    <table className=\"notice-list\">\n      <tbody>\n        {notices.map((n) => (\n          <NoticeRow key={n.id} date={formatDate(n.createdAt)} onClick={() => onSelect(n.id)} title={n.title} />\n        ))}\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default NoticeList;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport NoticeRow from \"./NoticeRow\";\nimport { fetchNotices } from \"../api/noticeApi\";\nimport { formatDate } from \"../utils/date\";\nimport { PAGE_SIZE } from \"../constants/board\";\nimport \"./NoticeList.css\";\n\ninterface Notice {\n  id: number;\n  title: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n}\n\ninterface NoticeListProps {\n  category: string;\n  onSelect: (id: number) => void;\n}\n\nfunction NoticeList({ category, onSelect }: NoticeListProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [notices, setNotices] = useState<Notice[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState<boolean>(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    fetchNotices(category, PAGE_SIZE).then((rows: Notice[]) => {\n      setNotices(rows);\n      setLoading(false);\n    });\n  }, [category]);\n\n  if (loading) return <p className=\"loading\">불러오는 중...</p>;\n  return (\n    <table className=\"notice-list\">\n      <tbody>\n        {notices.map((n) => (\n          <NoticeRow key={n.id} date={formatDate(n.createdAt)} onClick={() => onSelect(n.id)} title={n.title} />\n        ))}\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default NoticeList;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: ProductCard.jsx", "input": "import React from \"react\";\nimport Badge from \"./Badge\";\nimport { addToCart } from \"../store/cartSlice\";\nimport { useDispatch } from \"react-redux\";\nimport { formatPrice } from \"../utils/money\";\nimport placeholder from \"../assets/no-image.png\";\nimport \"./ProductCard.css\";\n\nfunction ProductCard({ product, featured }) {\n  const dispatch = useDispatch();\n  const handleAdd = () => dispatch(addToCart(product.id));\n  return (\n    <div className={featured ? \"card featured\" : \"card\"}>\n      <img src={product.image || placeholder} alt={product.name} />\n      {product.isNew && <Badge label=\"NEW\" />}\n      <h4>{product.name}</h4>\n      <span className=\"price\">{formatPrice(product.price)}</span>\n      <button onClick={handleAdd}>담기</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ProductCard;\n", "output": "import React from \"react\";\nimport Badge from \"./Badge\";\nimport { addToCart } from \"../store/cartSlice\";\nimport { useDispatch } from \"react-redux\";\nimport { formatPrice } from \"../utils/money\";\nimport placeholder from \"../assets/no-image.png\";\nimport \"./ProductCard.css\";\n\ninterface Product {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  price: number;\n  image?: string;\n  isNew?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface ProductCardProps {\n  product: Product;\n  featured?: boolean;\n}\n\nfunction ProductCard({ product, featured }: ProductCardProps): JSX.Element {\n  const dispatch = useDispatch();\n  const handleAdd = (): void => dispatch(addToCart(product.id));\n  return (\n    <div className={featured ? \"card featured\" : \"card\"}>\n      <img src={product.image || placeholder} alt={product.name} />\n      {product.isNew && <Badge label=\"NEW\" />}\n      <h4>{product.name}</h4>\n      <span className=\"price\">{formatPrice(product.price)}</span>\n      <button onClick={handleAdd}>담기</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ProductCard;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: SearchBar.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport SearchIcon from \"../icons/SearchIcon\";\nimport { useDebounce } from \"../hooks/useDebounce\";\nimport \"./SearchBar.css\";\n\nfunction SearchBar({ placeholder, onSearch }) {\n  const [keyword, setKeyword] = useState(\"\");\n  const debounced = useDebounce(keyword, 300);\n\n  const handleChange = (e) => setKeyword(e.target.value);\n  const handleSubmit = (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    onSearch(debounced);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form className=\"search-bar\" onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <SearchIcon />\n      <input value={keyword} onChange={handleChange} placeholder={placeholder} />\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default SearchBar;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport SearchIcon from \"../icons/SearchIcon\";\nimport { useDebounce } from \"../hooks/useDebounce\";\nimport \"./SearchBar.css\";\n\ninterface SearchBarProps {\n  placeholder: string;\n  onSearch: (keyword: string) => void;\n}\n\nfunction SearchBar({ placeholder, onSearch }: SearchBarProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [keyword, setKeyword] = useState<string>(\"\");\n  const debounced: string = useDebounce(keyword, 300);\n\n  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>): void => setKeyword(e.target.value);\n  const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>): void => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    onSearch(debounced);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form className=\"search-bar\" onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <SearchIcon />\n      <input value={keyword} onChange={handleChange} placeholder={placeholder} />\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default SearchBar;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: LoginForm.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { login } from \"../api/authApi\";\nimport FormField from \"./FormField\";\nimport { validateEmail } from \"../utils/validators\";\nimport \"./LoginForm.css\";\n\nfunction LoginForm({ onSuccess }) {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const [form, setForm] = useState({ email: \"\", password: \"\" });\n  const [error, setError] = useState(null);\n\n  const handleChange = (e) => {\n    const { name, value } = e.target;\n    setForm((prev) => ({ ...prev, [name]: value }));\n  };\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!validateEmail(form.email)) {\n      setError(\"이메일 형식이 올바르지 않습니다.\");\n      return;\n    }\n    const user = await login(form.email, form.password);\n    onSuccess(user);\n    navigate(\"/\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <FormField name=\"email\" value={form.email} onChange={handleChange} />\n      <FormField name=\"password\" type=\"password\" value={form.password} onChange={handleChange} />\n      {error && <p className=\"error\">{error}</p>}\n      <button type=\"submit\">로그인</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default LoginForm;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { login } from \"../api/authApi\";\nimport FormField from \"./FormField\";\nimport { validateEmail } from \"../utils/validators\";\nimport \"./LoginForm.css\";\n\ninterface User {\n  id: number;\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface LoginFormState {\n  email: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\ninterface LoginFormProps {\n  onSuccess: (user: User) => void;\n}\n\nfunction LoginForm({ onSuccess }: LoginFormProps): JSX.Element {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const [form, setForm] = useState<LoginFormState>({ email: \"\", password: \"\" });\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>): void => {\n    const { name, value } = e.target;\n    setForm((prev) => ({ ...prev, [name]: value }));\n  };\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>): Promise<void> => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!validateEmail(form.email)) {\n      setError(\"이메일 형식이 올바르지 않습니다.\");\n      return;\n    }\n    const user: User = await login(form.email, form.password);\n    onSuccess(user);\n    navigate(\"/\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <FormField name=\"email\" value={form.email} onChange={handleChange} />\n      <FormField name=\"password\" type=\"password\" value={form.password} onChange={handleChange} />\n      {error && <p className=\"error\">{error}</p>}\n      <button type=\"submit\">로그인</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default LoginForm;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: ConfirmDialog.jsx", "input": "import React from \"react\";\nimport ReactDOM from \"react-dom\";\nimport Button from \"./Button\";\nimport { useLockBodyScroll } from \"../hooks/useLockBodyScroll\";\nimport \"./ConfirmDialog.css\";\n\nfunction ConfirmDialog({ open, message, onConfirm, onCancel }) {\n  useLockBodyScroll(open);\n  if (!open) return null;\n  return ReactDOM.createPortal(\n    <div className=\"dialog-backdrop\" onClick={onCancel}>\n      <div className=\"dialog\" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n        <p>{message}</p>\n        <div className=\"dialog-actions\">\n          <Button variant=\"ghost\" onClick={onCancel}>취소</Button>\n          <Button variant=\"primary\" onClick={onConfirm}>확인</Button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>,\n    document.body\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ConfirmDialog;\n", "output": "import React from \"react\";\nimport ReactDOM from \"react-dom\";\nimport Button from \"./Button\";\nimport { useLockBodyScroll } from \"../hooks/useLockBodyScroll\";\nimport \"./ConfirmDialog.css\";\n\ninterface ConfirmDialogProps {\n  open: boolean;\n  message: string;\n  onConfirm: () => void;\n  onCancel: () => void;\n}\n\nfunction ConfirmDialog({ open, message, onConfirm, onCancel }: ConfirmDialogProps): React.ReactPortal | null {\n  useLockBodyScroll(open);\n  if (!open) return null;\n  return ReactDOM.createPortal(\n    <div className=\"dialog-backdrop\" onClick={onCancel}>\n      <div className=\"dialog\" onClick={(e: React.MouseEvent<HTMLDivElement>) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n        <p>{message}</p>\n        <div className=\"dialog-actions\">\n          <Button variant=\"ghost\" onClick={onCancel}>취소</Button>\n          <Button variant=\"primary\" onClick={onConfirm}>확인</Button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>,\n    document.body\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ConfirmDialog;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: TabPanel.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport TabButton from \"./TabButton\";\nimport \"./TabPanel.css\";\n\nfunction TabPanel({ tabs, defaultIndex }) {\n  const [active, setActive] = useState(defaultIndex || 0);\n  const current = tabs[active];\n  return (\n    <div className=\"tab-panel\">\n      <div className=\"tab-header\" role=\"tablist\">\n        {tabs.map((tab, i) => (\n          <TabButton key={tab.id} label={tab.label} selected={i === active} onClick={() => setActive(i)} />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"tab-body\">{current && current.content}</div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default TabPanel;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, ReactNode } from \"react\";\nimport TabButton from \"./TabButton\";\nimport \"./TabPanel.css\";\n\ninterface TabItem {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n  content: ReactNode;\n}\n\ninterface TabPanelProps {\n  tabs: TabItem[];\n  defaultIndex?: number;\n}\n\nfunction TabPanel({ tabs, defaultIndex }: TabPanelProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [active, setActive] = useState<number>(defaultIndex || 0);\n  const current: TabItem | undefined = tabs[active];\n  return (\n    <div className=\"tab-panel\">\n      <div className=\"tab-header\" role=\"tablist\">\n        {tabs.map((tab, i) => (\n          <TabButton key={tab.id} label={tab.label} selected={i === active} onClick={() => setActive(i)} />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"tab-body\">{current && current.content}</div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default TabPanel;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: TopNav.jsx", "input": "import React from \"react\";\nimport { NavLink } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport Logo from \"../assets/logo.svg\";\nimport { MENU_ITEMS } from \"../constants/menu\";\nimport UserMenu from \"./UserMenu\";\nimport \"./TopNav.css\";\n\nfunction TopNav({ user, onLogout }) {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"top-nav\">\n      <NavLink to=\"/\"><img src={Logo} alt=\"home\" /></NavLink>\n      <nav>\n        {MENU_ITEMS.map((item) => (\n          <NavLink key={item.path} to={item.path}>{item.label}</NavLink>\n        ))}\n      </nav>\n      {user ? <UserMenu user={user} onLogout={onLogout} /> : <NavLink to=\"/login\">로그인</NavLink>}\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default TopNav;\n", "output": "import React from \"react\";\nimport { NavLink } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport Logo from \"../assets/logo.svg\";\nimport { MENU_ITEMS } from \"../constants/menu\";\nimport UserMenu from \"./UserMenu\";\nimport \"./TopNav.css\";\n\ninterface CurrentUser {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface TopNavProps {\n  user: CurrentUser | null;\n  onLogout: () => void;\n}\n\nfunction TopNav({ user, onLogout }: TopNavProps): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"top-nav\">\n      <NavLink to=\"/\"><img src={Logo} alt=\"home\" /></NavLink>\n      <nav>\n        {MENU_ITEMS.map((item: { path: string; label: string }) => (\n          <NavLink key={item.path} to={item.path}>{item.label}</NavLink>\n        ))}\n      </nav>\n      {user ? <UserMenu user={user} onLogout={onLogout} /> : <NavLink to=\"/login\">로그인</NavLink>}\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default TopNav;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: ArticleDetail.jsx", "input": "import React, { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useParams, useLocation } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { fetchArticle } from \"../api/articleApi\";\nimport AttachmentList from \"./AttachmentList\";\nimport { formatDate } from \"../utils/date\";\n\nfunction ArticleDetail() {\n  const { id } = useParams();\n  const location = useLocation();\n  const preview = location.state;\n  const [article, setArticle] = useState(preview || null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetchArticle(id).then(setArticle);\n  }, [id]);\n\n  if (!article) return <p>로딩 중...</p>;\n  return (\n    <article>\n      <h1>{article.title}</h1>\n      <time>{formatDate(article.createdAt)}</time>\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: article.body }} />\n      <AttachmentList files={article.attachments} />\n    </article>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ArticleDetail;\n", "output": "import React, { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useParams, useLocation } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { fetchArticle } from \"../api/articleApi\";\nimport AttachmentList from \"./AttachmentList\";\nimport { formatDate } from \"../utils/date\";\n\ninterface Attachment {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  url: string;\n}\n\ninterface Article {\n  id: number;\n  title: string;\n  body: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n  attachments: Attachment[];\n}\n\ninterface ArticlePreviewState {\n  title: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n}\n\nfunction ArticleDetail(): JSX.Element {\n  const { id } = useParams() as { id: string };\n  const location = useLocation();\n  const preview = location.state as ArticlePreviewState | null;\n  const [article, setArticle] = useState<Article | null>(\n    preview ? ({ ...preview, id: 0, body: \"\", attachments: [] } as Article) : null\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetchArticle(id).then((data: Article) => setArticle(data));\n  }, [id]);\n\n  if (!article) return <p>로딩 중...</p>;\n  return (\n    <article>\n      <h1>{article.title}</h1>\n      <time>{formatDate(article.createdAt)}</time>\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: article.body }} />\n      <AttachmentList files={article.attachments} />\n    </article>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ArticleDetail;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: FileUploader.jsx", "input": "import React, { useRef, useState } from \"react\";\nimport UploadIcon from \"../icons/UploadIcon\";\nimport { uploadFile } from \"../api/fileApi\";\nimport { MAX_FILE_SIZE } from \"../constants/file\";\nimport \"./FileUploader.css\";\n\nfunction FileUploader({ onUploaded }) {\n  const inputRef = useRef(null);\n  const [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);\n\n  const openPicker = () => {\n    if (inputRef.current) inputRef.current.click();\n  };\n\n  const handleChange = async (e) => {\n    const file = e.target.files[0];\n    if (!file || file.size > MAX_FILE_SIZE) return;\n    const result = await uploadFile(file, setProgress);\n    onUploaded(result);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"uploader\">\n      <button onClick={openPicker}><UploadIcon /> 파일 선택</button>\n      <input ref={inputRef} type=\"file\" hidden onChange={handleChange} />\n      {progress > 0 && <progress value={progress} max={100} />}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default FileUploader;\n", "output": "import React, { useRef, useState } from \"react\";\nimport UploadIcon from \"../icons/UploadIcon\";\nimport { uploadFile } from \"../api/fileApi\";\nimport { MAX_FILE_SIZE } from \"../constants/file\";\nimport \"./FileUploader.css\";\n\ninterface UploadResult {\n  id: number;\n  url: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface FileUploaderProps {\n  onUploaded: (result: UploadResult) => void;\n}\n\nfunction FileUploader({ onUploaded }: FileUploaderProps): JSX.Element {\n  const inputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);\n  const [progress, setProgress] = useState<number>(0);\n\n  const openPicker = (): void => {\n    if (inputRef.current) inputRef.current.click();\n  };\n\n  const handleChange = async (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>): Promise<void> => {\n    const file: File | undefined = e.target.files?.[0];\n    if (!file || file.size > MAX_FILE_SIZE) return;\n    const result: UploadResult = await uploadFile(file, setProgress);\n    onUploaded(result);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"uploader\">\n      <button onClick={openPicker}><UploadIcon /> 파일 선택</button>\n      <input ref={inputRef} type=\"file\" hidden onChange={handleChange} />\n      {progress > 0 && <progress value={progress} max={100} />}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default FileUploader;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: PhotoGallery.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport Lightbox from \"./Lightbox\";\nimport Thumbnail from \"./Thumbnail\";\nimport { chunk } from \"../utils/array\";\nimport \"./PhotoGallery.css\";\n\nfunction PhotoGallery({ photos, columns }) {\n  const [selected, setSelected] = useState(null);\n  const rows = chunk(photos, columns || 3);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"gallery\">\n      {rows.map((row, ri) => (\n        <div className=\"gallery-row\" key={ri}>\n          {row.map((photo) => (\n            <Thumbnail key={photo.id} src={photo.thumb} onClick={() => setSelected(photo)} />\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n      {selected && <Lightbox photo={selected} onClose={() => setSelected(null)} />}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default PhotoGallery;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport Lightbox from \"./Lightbox\";\nimport Thumbnail from \"./Thumbnail\";\nimport { chunk } from \"../utils/array\";\nimport \"./PhotoGallery.css\";\n\ninterface Photo {\n  id: number;\n  thumb: string;\n  full: string;\n}\n\ninterface PhotoGalleryProps {\n  photos: Photo[];\n  columns?: number;\n}\n\nfunction PhotoGallery({ photos, columns }: PhotoGalleryProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [selected, setSelected] = useState<Photo | null>(null);\n  const rows: Photo[][] = chunk(photos, columns || 3);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"gallery\">\n      {rows.map((row, ri) => (\n        <div className=\"gallery-row\" key={ri}>\n          {row.map((photo) => (\n            <Thumbnail key={photo.id} src={photo.thumb} onClick={() => setSelected(photo)} />\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n      {selected && <Lightbox photo={selected} onClose={() => setSelected(null)} />}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default PhotoGallery;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: ToastPopup.jsx", "input": "import React, { useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport classNames from \"classnames\";\nimport CloseIcon from \"../icons/CloseIcon\";\nimport \"./ToastPopup.css\";\n\nfunction ToastPopup({ type, message, duration, onClose }) {\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const timer = setTimeout(onClose, duration || 3000);\n    return () => clearTimeout(timer);\n  }, [duration, onClose]);\n\n  return (\n    <div className={classNames(\"toast\", type)}>\n      <span>{message}</span>\n      <button onClick={onClose}><CloseIcon /></button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ToastPopup;\n", "output": "import React, { useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport classNames from \"classnames\";\nimport CloseIcon from \"../icons/CloseIcon\";\nimport \"./ToastPopup.css\";\n\ntype ToastType = \"success\" | \"error\" | \"info\";\n\ninterface ToastPopupProps {\n  type: ToastType;\n  message: string;\n  duration?: number;\n  onClose: () => void;\n}\n\nfunction ToastPopup({ type, message, duration, onClose }: ToastPopupProps): JSX.Element {\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> = setTimeout(onClose, duration || 3000);\n    return () => clearTimeout(timer);\n  }, [duration, onClose]);\n\n  return (\n    <div className={classNames(\"toast\", type)}>\n      <span>{message}</span>\n      <button onClick={onClose}><CloseIcon /></button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ToastPopup;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: Pager.jsx", "input": "import React from \"react\";\nimport PrevIcon from \"../icons/PrevIcon\";\nimport NextIcon from \"../icons/NextIcon\";\nimport { range } from \"../utils/array\";\nimport \"./Pager.css\";\n\nfunction Pager({ current, total, onChange }) {\n  const pages = range(1, total);\n  const go = (p) => {\n    if (p >= 1 && p <= total) onChange(p);\n  };\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"pager\">\n      <button disabled={current === 1} onClick={() => go(current - 1)}><PrevIcon /></button>\n      {pages.map((p) => (\n        <button key={p} className={p === current ? \"active\" : \"\"} onClick={() => go(p)}>{p}</button>\n      ))}\n      <button disabled={current === total} onClick={() => go(current + 1)}><NextIcon /></button>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default Pager;\n", "output": "import React from \"react\";\nimport PrevIcon from \"../icons/PrevIcon\";\nimport NextIcon from \"../icons/NextIcon\";\nimport { range } from \"../utils/array\";\nimport \"./Pager.css\";\n\ninterface PagerProps {\n  current: number;\n  total: number;\n  onChange: (page: number) => void;\n}\n\nfunction Pager({ current, total, onChange }: PagerProps): JSX.Element {\n  const pages: number[] = range(1, total);\n  const go = (p: number): void => {\n    if (p >= 1 && p <= total) onChange(p);\n  };\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"pager\">\n      <button disabled={current === 1} onClick={() => go(current - 1)}><PrevIcon /></button>\n      {pages.map((p) => (\n        <button key={p} className={p === current ? \"active\" : \"\"} onClick={() => go(p)}>{p}</button>\n      ))}\n      <button disabled={current === total} onClick={() => go(current + 1)}><NextIcon /></button>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default Pager;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: FilterPanel.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport Checkbox from \"./Checkbox\";\nimport { CATEGORY_OPTIONS } from \"../constants/filter\";\nimport \"./FilterPanel.css\";\n\nfunction FilterPanel({ onApply }) {\n  const [selected, setSelected] = useState([]);\n\n  const toggle = (value) => {\n    setSelected((prev) =>\n      prev.includes(value) ? prev.filter((v) => v !== value) : [...prev, value]\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <aside className=\"filter-panel\">\n      {CATEGORY_OPTIONS.map((opt) => (\n        <Checkbox key={opt.value} label={opt.label} checked={selected.includes(opt.value)} onChange={() => toggle(opt.value)} />\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => onApply(selected)}>적용</button>\n    </aside>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default FilterPanel;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport Checkbox from \"./Checkbox\";\nimport { CATEGORY_OPTIONS } from \"../constants/filter\";\nimport \"./FilterPanel.css\";\n\ninterface FilterPanelProps {\n  onApply: (selected: string[]) => void;\n}\n\nfunction FilterPanel({ onApply }: FilterPanelProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [selected, setSelected] = useState<string[]>([]);\n\n  const toggle = (value: string): void => {\n    setSelected((prev) =>\n      prev.includes(value) ? prev.filter((v) => v !== value) : [...prev, value]\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <aside className=\"filter-panel\">\n      {CATEGORY_OPTIONS.map((opt: { value: string; label: string }) => (\n        <Checkbox key={opt.value} label={opt.label} checked={selected.includes(opt.value)} onChange={() => toggle(opt.value)} />\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => onApply(selected)}>적용</button>\n    </aside>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default FilterPanel;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: FaqAccordion.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport ChevronIcon from \"../icons/ChevronIcon\";\nimport \"./FaqAccordion.css\";\n\nfunction FaqAccordion({ items }) {\n  const [openId, setOpenId] = useState(null);\n  const toggle = (id) => setOpenId((prev) => (prev === id ? null : id));\n\n  return (\n    <ul className=\"faq\">\n      {items.map((item) => (\n        <li key={item.id} className={openId === item.id ? \"open\" : \"\"}>\n          <button onClick={() => toggle(item.id)}>\n            {item.question}\n            <ChevronIcon open={openId === item.id} />\n          </button>\n          {openId === item.id && <div className=\"answer\">{item.answer}</div>}\n        </li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default FaqAccordion;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport ChevronIcon from \"../icons/ChevronIcon\";\nimport \"./FaqAccordion.css\";\n\ninterface FaqItem {\n  id: number;\n  question: string;\n  answer: string;\n}\n\ninterface FaqAccordionProps {\n  items: FaqItem[];\n}\n\nfunction FaqAccordion({ items }: FaqAccordionProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [openId, setOpenId] = useState<number | null>(null);\n  const toggle = (id: number): void => setOpenId((prev) => (prev === id ? null : id));\n\n  return (\n    <ul className=\"faq\">\n      {items.map((item) => (\n        <li key={item.id} className={openId === item.id ? \"open\" : \"\"}>\n          <button onClick={() => toggle(item.id)}>\n            {item.question}\n            <ChevronIcon open={openId === item.id} />\n          </button>\n          {openId === item.id && <div className=\"answer\">{item.answer}</div>}\n        </li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default FaqAccordion;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: CommentSection.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport CommentItem from \"./CommentItem\";\nimport { fetchComments, postComment } from \"../api/commentApi\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../hooks/useAuth\";\nimport Avatar from \"./Avatar\";\nimport \"./CommentSection.css\";\n\nfunction CommentSection({ postId }) {\n  const { user } = useAuth();\n  const [comments, setComments] = useState([]);\n  const [text, setText] = useState(\"\");\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetchComments(postId).then(setComments);\n  }, [postId]);\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!text.trim()) return;\n    const created = await postComment(postId, text);\n    setComments((prev) => [...prev, created]);\n    setText(\"\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"comments\">\n      <ul>\n        {comments.map((c) => (\n          <CommentItem key={c.id} comment={c} />\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n      {user && (\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n          <Avatar src={user.avatar} />\n          <textarea value={text} onChange={(e) => setText(e.target.value)} />\n          <button type=\"submit\">등록</button>\n        </form>\n      )}\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default CommentSection;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport CommentItem from \"./CommentItem\";\nimport { fetchComments, postComment } from \"../api/commentApi\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../hooks/useAuth\";\nimport Avatar from \"./Avatar\";\nimport \"./CommentSection.css\";\n\ninterface Comment {\n  id: number;\n  author: string;\n  body: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n}\n\ninterface CommentSectionProps {\n  postId: number;\n}\n\nfunction CommentSection({ postId }: CommentSectionProps): JSX.Element {\n  const { user } = useAuth();\n  const [comments, setComments] = useState<Comment[]>([]);\n  const [text, setText] = useState<string>(\"\");\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetchComments(postId).then((rows: Comment[]) => setComments(rows));\n  }, [postId]);\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>): Promise<void> => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!text.trim()) return;\n    const created: Comment = await postComment(postId, text);\n    setComments((prev) => [...prev, created]);\n    setText(\"\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"comments\">\n      <ul>\n        {comments.map((c) => (\n          <CommentItem key={c.id} comment={c} />\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n      {user && (\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n          <Avatar src={user.avatar} />\n          <textarea value={text} onChange={(e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLTextAreaElement>) => setText(e.target.value)} />\n          <button type=\"submit\">등록</button>\n        </form>\n      )}\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default CommentSection;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: SidebarMenu.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport { Link } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport FolderIcon from \"../icons/FolderIcon\";\nimport \"./SidebarMenu.css\";\n\nfunction SidebarMenu({ tree, currentPath }) {\n  const [expanded, setExpanded] = useState({});\n\n  const toggle = (id) => setExpanded((prev) => ({ ...prev, [id]: !prev[id] }));\n\n  const renderNode = (node) => (\n    <li key={node.id}>\n      {node.children ? (\n        <>\n          <button onClick={() => toggle(node.id)}><FolderIcon /> {node.label}</button>\n          {expanded[node.id] && <ul>{node.children.map(renderNode)}</ul>}\n        </>\n      ) : (\n        <Link to={node.path} className={node.path === currentPath ? \"active\" : \"\"}>{node.label}</Link>\n      )}\n    </li>\n  );\n\n  return <ul className=\"sidebar-menu\">{tree.map(renderNode)}</ul>;\n}\n\nexport default SidebarMenu;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport { Link } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport FolderIcon from \"../icons/FolderIcon\";\nimport \"./SidebarMenu.css\";\n\ninterface MenuNode {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n  path: string;\n  children?: MenuNode[];\n}\n\ninterface SidebarMenuProps {\n  tree: MenuNode[];\n  currentPath: string;\n}\n\nfunction SidebarMenu({ tree, currentPath }: SidebarMenuProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [expanded, setExpanded] = useState<Record<string, boolean>>({});\n\n  const toggle = (id: string): void => setExpanded((prev) => ({ ...prev, [id]: !prev[id] }));\n\n  const renderNode = (node: MenuNode): JSX.Element => (\n    <li key={node.id}>\n      {node.children ? (\n        <>\n          <button onClick={() => toggle(node.id)}><FolderIcon /> {node.label}</button>\n          {expanded[node.id] && <ul>{node.children.map(renderNode)}</ul>}\n        </>\n      ) : (\n        <Link to={node.path} className={node.path === currentPath ? \"active\" : \"\"}>{node.label}</Link>\n      )}\n    </li>\n  );\n\n  return <ul className=\"sidebar-menu\">{tree.map(renderNode)}</ul>;\n}\n\nexport default SidebarMenu;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: DashboardPage.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport StatCard from \"../components/StatCard\";\nimport SalesChart from \"../components/SalesChart\";\nimport TopProducts from \"../components/TopProducts\";\nimport DateRangePicker from \"../components/DateRangePicker\";\nimport Spinner from \"../components/Spinner\";\nimport { fetchDashboard } from \"../api/dashboardApi\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../hooks/useAuth\";\nimport { formatPrice } from \"../utils/money\";\nimport \"./DashboardPage.css\";\n\nfunction DashboardPage() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const { user } = useAuth();\n  const [range, setRange] = useState({ from: null, to: null });\n  const [data, setData] = useState(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  const load = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    const result = await fetchDashboard(range);\n    setData(result);\n    setLoading(false);\n  }, [range]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    load();\n  }, [load]);\n\n  if (loading || !data) return <Spinner />;\n\n  return (\n    <main className=\"dashboard\">\n      <header>\n        <h1>안녕하세요, {user.name}님</h1>\n        <DateRangePicker value={range} onChange={setRange} />\n      </header>\n      <section className=\"stats\">\n        <StatCard title=\"총 매출\" value={formatPrice(data.totalSales)} />\n        <StatCard title=\"주문 수\" value={data.orderCount} />\n        <StatCard title=\"신규 회원\" value={data.newUsers} />\n      </section>\n      <section className=\"charts\">\n        <SalesChart series={data.salesSeries} />\n        <TopProducts items={data.topProducts} onSelect={(id) => navigate(`/products/${id}`)} />\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default DashboardPage;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport StatCard from \"../components/StatCard\";\nimport SalesChart from \"../components/SalesChart\";\nimport TopProducts from \"../components/TopProducts\";\nimport DateRangePicker from \"../components/DateRangePicker\";\nimport Spinner from \"../components/Spinner\";\nimport { fetchDashboard } from \"../api/dashboardApi\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../hooks/useAuth\";\nimport { formatPrice } from \"../utils/money\";\nimport \"./DashboardPage.css\";\n\ninterface DateRange {\n  from: string | null;\n  to: string | null;\n}\n\ninterface SalesPoint {\n  date: string;\n  amount: number;\n}\n\ninterface TopProduct {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  sales: number;\n}\n\ninterface DashboardData {\n  totalSales: number;\n  orderCount: number;\n  newUsers: number;\n  salesSeries: SalesPoint[];\n  topProducts: TopProduct[];\n}\n\nfunction DashboardPage(): JSX.Element {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const { user } = useAuth();\n  const [range, setRange] = useState<DateRange>({ from: null, to: null });\n  const [data, setData] = useState<DashboardData | null>(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState<boolean>(true);\n\n  const load = useCallback(async (): Promise<void> => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    const result: DashboardData = await fetchDashboard(range);\n    setData(result);\n    setLoading(false);\n  }, [range]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    load();\n  }, [load]);\n\n  if (loading || !data) return <Spinner />;\n\n  return (\n    <main className=\"dashboard\">\n      <header>\n        <h1>안녕하세요, {user.name}님</h1>\n        <DateRangePicker value={range} onChange={setRange} />\n      </header>\n      <section className=\"stats\">\n        <StatCard title=\"총 매출\" value={formatPrice(data.totalSales)} />\n        <StatCard title=\"주문 수\" value={data.orderCount} />\n        <StatCard title=\"신규 회원\" value={data.newUsers} />\n      </section>\n      <section className=\"charts\">\n        <SalesChart series={data.salesSeries} />\n        <TopProducts items={data.topProducts} onSelect={(id: number) => navigate(`/products/${id}`)} />\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default DashboardPage;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: ProfileEditPage.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate, useParams } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport TextInput from \"../components/TextInput\";\nimport AvatarUploader from \"../components/AvatarUploader\";\nimport FormActions from \"../components/FormActions\";\nimport Spinner from \"../components/Spinner\";\nimport { fetchProfile, updateProfile } from \"../api/profileApi\";\nimport { validateProfile } from \"../utils/validators\";\nimport \"./ProfileEditPage.css\";\n\nfunction ProfileEditPage() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const { userId } = useParams();\n  const [profile, setProfile] = useState(null);\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState({});\n  const [saving, setSaving] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetchProfile(userId).then(setProfile);\n  }, [userId]);\n\n  const setField = (name, value) => {\n    setProfile((prev) => ({ ...prev, [name]: value }));\n  };\n\n  const handleSave = async () => {\n    const found = validateProfile(profile);\n    if (Object.keys(found).length > 0) {\n      setErrors(found);\n      return;\n    }\n    setSaving(true);\n    await updateProfile(userId, profile);\n    setSaving(false);\n    navigate(`/users/${userId}`);\n  };\n\n  if (!profile) return <Spinner />;\n\n  return (\n    <form className=\"profile-edit\" onSubmit={(e) => e.preventDefault()}>\n      <AvatarUploader value={profile.avatar} onChange={(url) => setField(\"avatar\", url)} />\n      <TextInput label=\"이름\" value={profile.name} error={errors.name} onChange={(v) => setField(\"name\", v)} />\n      <TextInput label=\"이메일\" value={profile.email} error={errors.email} onChange={(v) => setField(\"email\", v)} />\n      <FormActions saving={saving} onSave={handleSave} onCancel={() => navigate(-1)} />\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ProfileEditPage;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate, useParams } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport TextInput from \"../components/TextInput\";\nimport AvatarUploader from \"../components/AvatarUploader\";\nimport FormActions from \"../components/FormActions\";\nimport Spinner from \"../components/Spinner\";\nimport { fetchProfile, updateProfile } from \"../api/profileApi\";\nimport { validateProfile } from \"../utils/validators\";\nimport \"./ProfileEditPage.css\";\n\ninterface Profile {\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  avatar: string;\n}\n\ntype ProfileErrors = Partial<Record<keyof Profile, string>>;\n\nfunction ProfileEditPage(): JSX.Element {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const { userId } = useParams() as { userId: string };\n  const [profile, setProfile] = useState<Profile | null>(null);\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState<ProfileErrors>({});\n  const [saving, setSaving] = useState<boolean>(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetchProfile(userId).then((data: Profile) => setProfile(data));\n  }, [userId]);\n\n  const setField = <K extends keyof Profile>(name: K, value: Profile[K]): void => {\n    setProfile((prev) => (prev ? { ...prev, [name]: value } : prev));\n  };\n\n  const handleSave = async (): Promise<void> => {\n    if (!profile) return;\n    const found: ProfileErrors = validateProfile(profile);\n    if (Object.keys(found).length > 0) {\n      setErrors(found);\n      return;\n    }\n    setSaving(true);\n    await updateProfile(userId, profile);\n    setSaving(false);\n    navigate(`/users/${userId}`);\n  };\n\n  if (!profile) return <Spinner />;\n\n  return (\n    <form className=\"profile-edit\" onSubmit={(e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => e.preventDefault()}>\n      <AvatarUploader value={profile.avatar} onChange={(url: string) => setField(\"avatar\", url)} />\n      <TextInput label=\"이름\" value={profile.name} error={errors.name} onChange={(v: string) => setField(\"name\", v)} />\n      <TextInput label=\"이메일\" value={profile.email} error={errors.email} onChange={(v: string) => setField(\"email\", v)} />\n      <FormActions saving={saving} onSave={handleSave} onCancel={() => navigate(-1)} />\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ProfileEditPage;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: Breadcrumb.jsx", "input": "import React from \"react\";\nimport { Link } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport HomeIcon from \"../icons/HomeIcon\";\nimport \"./Breadcrumb.css\";\n\nfunction Breadcrumb({ trail }) {\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n      <Link to=\"/\"><HomeIcon /></Link>\n      {trail.map((crumb, i) => (\n        <span key={crumb.path}>\n          <span className=\"sep\">/</span>\n          {i === trail.length - 1 ? (\n            <span className=\"current\">{crumb.label}</span>\n          ) : (\n            <Link to={crumb.path}>{crumb.label}</Link>\n          )}\n        </span>\n      ))}\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default Breadcrumb;\n", "output": "import React from \"react\";\nimport { Link } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport HomeIcon from \"../icons/HomeIcon\";\nimport \"./Breadcrumb.css\";\n\ninterface Crumb {\n  label: string;\n  path: string;\n}\n\ninterface BreadcrumbProps {\n  trail: Crumb[];\n}\n\nfunction Breadcrumb({ trail }: BreadcrumbProps): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n      <Link to=\"/\"><HomeIcon /></Link>\n      {trail.map((crumb, i) => (\n        <span key={crumb.path}>\n          <span className=\"sep\">/</span>\n          {i === trail.length - 1 ? (\n            <span className=\"current\">{crumb.label}</span>\n          ) : (\n            <Link to={crumb.path}>{crumb.label}</Link>\n          )}\n        </span>\n      ))}\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default Breadcrumb;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: RatingStars.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport StarIcon from \"../icons/StarIcon\";\nimport \"./RatingStars.css\";\n\nfunction RatingStars({ value, max, onChange, readOnly }) {\n  const [hover, setHover] = useState(0);\n  const stars = Array.from({ length: max || 5 }, (_, i) => i + 1);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"rating\">\n      {stars.map((n) => (\n        <button\n          key={n}\n          disabled={readOnly}\n          onMouseEnter={() => setHover(n)}\n          onMouseLeave={() => setHover(0)}\n          onClick={() => onChange && onChange(n)}\n        >\n          <StarIcon filled={n <= (hover || value)} />\n        </button>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default RatingStars;\n", "output": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport StarIcon from \"../icons/StarIcon\";\nimport \"./RatingStars.css\";\n\ninterface RatingStarsProps {\n  value: number;\n  max?: number;\n  onChange?: (value: number) => void;\n  readOnly?: boolean;\n}\n\nfunction RatingStars({ value, max, onChange, readOnly }: RatingStarsProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [hover, setHover] = useState<number>(0);\n  const stars: number[] = Array.from({ length: max || 5 }, (_, i) => i + 1);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"rating\">\n      {stars.map((n) => (\n        <button\n          key={n}\n          disabled={readOnly}\n          onMouseEnter={() => setHover(n)}\n          onMouseLeave={() => setHover(0)}\n          onClick={() => onChange && onChange(n)}\n        >\n          <StarIcon filled={n <= (hover || value)} />\n        </button>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default RatingStars;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: DataGridToolbar.jsx", "input": "import React from \"react\";\nimport IconButton from \"./IconButton\";\nimport { ReactComponent as ExportIcon } from \"../icons/export.svg\";\nimport { ReactComponent as RefreshIcon } from \"../icons/refresh.svg\";\nimport { exportCsv } from \"../utils/csv\";\nimport \"./DataGridToolbar.css\";\n\nfunction DataGridToolbar({ rows, selectedCount, onRefresh, onDelete }) {\n  const handleExport = () => exportCsv(rows, \"data.csv\");\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid-toolbar\">\n      <span>{selectedCount}개 선택됨</span>\n      <IconButton onClick={onRefresh}><RefreshIcon /></IconButton>\n      <IconButton onClick={handleExport}><ExportIcon /></IconButton>\n      <button disabled={selectedCount === 0} onClick={onDelete}>삭제</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default DataGridToolbar;\n", "output": "import React from \"react\";\nimport IconButton from \"./IconButton\";\nimport { ReactComponent as ExportIcon } from \"../icons/export.svg\";\nimport { ReactComponent as RefreshIcon } from \"../icons/refresh.svg\";\nimport { exportCsv } from \"../utils/csv\";\nimport \"./DataGridToolbar.css\";\n\ninterface GridRow {\n  id: number;\n  [column: string]: unknown;\n}\n\ninterface DataGridToolbarProps {\n  rows: GridRow[];\n  selectedCount: number;\n  onRefresh: () => void;\n  onDelete: () => void;\n}\n\nfunction DataGridToolbar({ rows, selectedCount, onRefresh, onDelete }: DataGridToolbarProps): JSX.Element {\n  const handleExport = (): void => exportCsv(rows, \"data.csv\");\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid-toolbar\">\n      <span>{selectedCount}개 선택됨</span>\n      <IconButton onClick={onRefresh}><RefreshIcon /></IconButton>\n      <IconButton onClick={handleExport}><ExportIcon /></IconButton>\n      <button disabled={selectedCount === 0} onClick={onDelete}>삭제</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default DataGridToolbar;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: NotificationBell.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState, useRef } from \"react\";\nimport BellIcon from \"../icons/BellIcon\";\nimport NotificationItem from \"./NotificationItem\";\nimport { useOnClickOutside } from \"../hooks/useOnClickOutside\";\nimport \"./NotificationBell.css\";\n\nfunction NotificationBell({ notifications, onRead }) {\n  const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);\n  const ref = useRef(null);\n  useOnClickOutside(ref, () => setOpen(false));\n\n  const unread = notifications.filter((n) => !n.read).length;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bell\" ref={ref}>\n      <button onClick={() => setOpen((o) => !o)}>\n        <BellIcon />\n        {unread > 0 && <span className=\"badge\">{unread}</span>}\n      </button>\n      {open && (\n        <ul className=\"dropdown\">\n          {notifications.map((n) => (\n            <NotificationItem key={n.id} item={n} onClick={() => onRead(n.id)} />\n          ))}\n        </ul>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default NotificationBell;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, useRef } from \"react\";\nimport BellIcon from \"../icons/BellIcon\";\nimport NotificationItem from \"./NotificationItem\";\nimport { useOnClickOutside } from \"../hooks/useOnClickOutside\";\nimport \"./NotificationBell.css\";\n\ninterface Notification {\n  id: number;\n  text: string;\n  read: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface NotificationBellProps {\n  notifications: Notification[];\n  onRead: (id: number) => void;\n}\n\nfunction NotificationBell({ notifications, onRead }: NotificationBellProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [open, setOpen] = useState<boolean>(false);\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  useOnClickOutside(ref, () => setOpen(false));\n\n  const unread: number = notifications.filter((n) => !n.read).length;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bell\" ref={ref}>\n      <button onClick={() => setOpen((o) => !o)}>\n        <BellIcon />\n        {unread > 0 && <span className=\"badge\">{unread}</span>}\n      </button>\n      {open && (\n        <ul className=\"dropdown\">\n          {notifications.map((n) => (\n            <NotificationItem key={n.id} item={n} onClick={() => onRead(n.id)} />\n          ))}\n        </ul>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default NotificationBell;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: StepWizard.jsx", "input": "import React, { useState } from \"react\";\nimport StepIndicator from \"./StepIndicator\";\nimport { STEPS } from \"../constants/wizard\";\nimport \"./StepWizard.css\";\n\nfunction StepWizard({ onComplete }) {\n  const [step, setStep] = useState(0);\n  const [values, setValues] = useState({});\n\n  const next = (partial) => {\n    const merged = { ...values, ...partial };\n    setValues(merged);\n    if (step === STEPS.length - 1) {\n      onComplete(merged);\n    } else {\n      setStep((s) => s + 1);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const Current = STEPS[step].component;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"wizard\">\n      <StepIndicator steps={STEPS} active={step} />\n      <Current values={values} onNext={next} onBack={() => setStep((s) => Math.max(0, s - 1))} />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default StepWizard;\n", "output": "import React, { useState, ComponentType } from \"react\";\nimport StepIndicator from \"./StepIndicator\";\nimport { STEPS } from \"../constants/wizard\";\nimport \"./StepWizard.css\";\n\ninterface WizardValues {\n  [field: string]: unknown;\n}\n\ninterface StepComponentProps {\n  values: WizardValues;\n  onNext: (partial: WizardValues) => void;\n  onBack: () => void;\n}\n\ninterface WizardStep {\n  label: string;\n  component: ComponentType<StepComponentProps>;\n}\n\ninterface StepWizardProps {\n  onComplete: (values: WizardValues) => void;\n}\n\nfunction StepWizard({ onComplete }: StepWizardProps): JSX.Element {\n  const [step, setStep] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [values, setValues] = useState<WizardValues>({});\n\n  const next = (partial: WizardValues): void => {\n    const merged: WizardValues = { ...values, ...partial };\n    setValues(merged);\n    if (step === STEPS.length - 1) {\n      onComplete(merged);\n    } else {\n      setStep((s) => s + 1);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const Current: ComponentType<StepComponentProps> = (STEPS as WizardStep[])[step].component;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"wizard\">\n      <StepIndicator steps={STEPS} active={step} />\n      <Current values={values} onNext={next} onBack={() => setStep((s) => Math.max(0, s - 1))} />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default StepWizard;\n"}
{"instruction": "다음 React 컴포넌트(JavaScript)를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 변환해줘. 원본의 모든 import를 한 줄도 빠짐없이 그대로 보존하고, props는 interface로, 모든 상태/이벤트핸들러/함수에 타입을 정확히 붙여줘. 파일: CartSummary.jsx", "input": "import React, { useMemo } from \"react\";\nimport CartLine from \"./CartLine\";\nimport { formatPrice } from \"../utils/money\";\nimport { SHIPPING_FEE, FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD } from \"../constants/order\";\nimport \"./CartSummary.css\";\n\nfunction CartSummary({ items, onCheckout }) {\n  const subtotal = useMemo(\n    () => items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0),\n    [items]\n  );\n  const shipping = subtotal >= FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD ? 0 : SHIPPING_FEE;\n  const total = subtotal + shipping;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"cart-summary\">\n      <ul>\n        {items.map((item) => (\n          <CartLine key={item.id} item={item} />\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n      <dl>\n        <dt>상품 합계</dt><dd>{formatPrice(subtotal)}</dd>\n        <dt>배송비</dt><dd>{formatPrice(shipping)}</dd>\n        <dt>총 결제금액</dt><dd>{formatPrice(total)}</dd>\n      </dl>\n      <button disabled={items.length === 0} onClick={() => onCheckout(total)}>결제하기</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default CartSummary;\n", "output": "import React, { useMemo } from \"react\";\nimport CartLine from \"./CartLine\";\nimport { formatPrice } from \"../utils/money\";\nimport { SHIPPING_FEE, FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD } from \"../constants/order\";\nimport \"./CartSummary.css\";\n\ninterface CartItem {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  price: number;\n  quantity: number;\n}\n\ninterface CartSummaryProps {\n  items: CartItem[];\n  onCheckout: (total: number) => void;\n}\n\nfunction CartSummary({ items, onCheckout }: CartSummaryProps): JSX.Element {\n  const subtotal: number = useMemo(\n    () => items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0),\n    [items]\n  );\n  const shipping: number = subtotal >= FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD ? 0 : SHIPPING_FEE;\n  const total: number = subtotal + shipping;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"cart-summary\">\n      <ul>\n        {items.map((item) => (\n          <CartLine key={item.id} item={item} />\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n      <dl>\n        <dt>상품 합계</dt><dd>{formatPrice(subtotal)}</dd>\n        <dt>배송비</dt><dd>{formatPrice(shipping)}</dd>\n        <dt>총 결제금액</dt><dd>{formatPrice(total)}</dd>\n      </dl>\n      <button disabled={items.length === 0} onClick={() => onCheckout(total)}>결제하기</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default CartSummary;\n"}
{"instruction": "제네릭 리스트 컴포넌트 GenericList<T>를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. 각 항목의 React key는 keyof T로 지정된 식별자 필드에서 가져오되, keyof T가 symbol을 포함할 수 있으므로 key에 직접 넣지 말고 String(...)으로 감싸 안전하게 처리해줘. 파일: GenericList.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import React from \"react\";\n\ninterface GenericListProps<T> {\n  items: T[];\n  idField: keyof T;\n  renderItem: (item: T) => React.ReactNode;\n}\n\nfunction GenericList<T>({ items, idField, renderItem }: GenericListProps<T>): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <ul>\n      {items.map((item) => {\n        const rawKey: T[keyof T] = item[idField];\n        return <li key={String(rawKey)}>{renderItem(item)}</li>;\n      })}\n    </ul>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default GenericList;\n"}
{"instruction": "제네릭 선택 칩 컴포넌트 ChipSelect<T>를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. 옵션 배열을 받아 각 칩을 렌더링하고, key는 제네릭 옵션의 keyof T 식별 필드를 String()으로 감싸 만들고, 클릭 시 선택된 옵션 전체(T)를 콜백으로 넘겨줘. 파일: ChipSelect.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import React from \"react\";\n\ninterface ChipSelectProps<T> {\n  options: T[];\n  labelField: keyof T;\n  valueField: keyof T;\n  selected: T | null;\n  onSelect: (option: T) => void;\n}\n\nfunction ChipSelect<T>({ options, labelField, valueField, selected, onSelect }: ChipSelectProps<T>): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"chips\">\n      {options.map((option) => {\n        const id: T[keyof T] = option[valueField];\n        const isActive: boolean = selected != null && selected[valueField] === id;\n        return (\n          <button\n            key={String(id)}\n            className={isActive ? \"chip active\" : \"chip\"}\n            onClick={() => onSelect(option)}\n          >\n            {String(option[labelField])}\n          </button>\n        );\n      })}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default ChipSelect;\n"}
{"instruction": "Card 래퍼 컴포넌트를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. React 18에서는 React.FC가 children을 자동 포함하지 않으므로, props 인터페이스에 children: React.ReactNode를 명시적으로 선언해서 children을 받도록 해줘. 파일: Card.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import React from \"react\";\n\ninterface CardProps {\n  title: string;\n  footer?: React.ReactNode;\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n}\n\nconst Card: React.FC<CardProps> = ({ title, footer, children }) => {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"card\">\n      <header className=\"card-title\">{title}</header>\n      <div className=\"card-body\">{children}</div>\n      {footer && <footer className=\"card-footer\">{footer}</footer>}\n    </section>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Card;\n"}
{"instruction": "PageLayout 컴포넌트를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. React.FC를 쓰지 않고 일반 함수 컴포넌트 형태로 작성하되, children을 받는 props 타입에 children: React.ReactNode를 명시하고 사이드바/헤더 슬롯도 ReactNode로 받아줘. 파일: PageLayout.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import React from \"react\";\n\ninterface PageLayoutProps {\n  header: React.ReactNode;\n  sidebar?: React.ReactNode;\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n}\n\nfunction PageLayout({ header, sidebar, children }: PageLayoutProps): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"layout\">\n      <header className=\"layout-header\">{header}</header>\n      <div className=\"layout-main\">\n        {sidebar && <aside className=\"layout-sidebar\">{sidebar}</aside>}\n        <main className=\"layout-content\">{children}</main>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default PageLayout;\n"}
{"instruction": "할 일 목록 상태를 useReducer로 관리하는 훅 useTodos를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. 액션은 판별 유니온(discriminated union)으로 ADD/TOGGLE/REMOVE/CLEAR_COMPLETED를 정의하고, reducer의 switch가 각 액션 타입을 정확히 좁히도록(payload 타입 안전) 작성해줘. 파일: useTodos.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import { useReducer } from \"react\";\n\ninterface Todo {\n  id: number;\n  text: string;\n  done: boolean;\n}\n\ntype TodoAction =\n  | { type: \"ADD\"; text: string }\n  | { type: \"TOGGLE\"; id: number }\n  | { type: \"REMOVE\"; id: number }\n  | { type: \"CLEAR_COMPLETED\" };\n\nfunction todoReducer(state: Todo[], action: TodoAction): Todo[] {\n  switch (action.type) {\n    case \"ADD\":\n      return [...state, { id: Date.now(), text: action.text, done: false }];\n    case \"TOGGLE\":\n      return state.map((t) => (t.id === action.id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t));\n    case \"REMOVE\":\n      return state.filter((t) => t.id !== action.id);\n    case \"CLEAR_COMPLETED\":\n      return state.filter((t) => !t.done);\n    default:\n      return state;\n  }\n}\n\ninterface UseTodosResult {\n  todos: Todo[];\n  add: (text: string) => void;\n  toggle: (id: number) => void;\n  remove: (id: number) => void;\n  clearCompleted: () => void;\n}\n\nexport function useTodos(initial: Todo[] = []): UseTodosResult {\n  const [todos, dispatch] = useReducer(todoReducer, initial);\n  return {\n    todos,\n    add: (text: string) => dispatch({ type: \"ADD\", text }),\n    toggle: (id: number) => dispatch({ type: \"TOGGLE\", id }),\n    remove: (id: number) => dispatch({ type: \"REMOVE\", id }),\n    clearCompleted: () => dispatch({ type: \"CLEAR_COMPLETED\" }),\n  };\n}\n"}
{"instruction": "장바구니 상태 reducer를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. 액션은 판별 유니온으로 ADD_ITEM/REMOVE_ITEM/UPDATE_QTY/CLEAR를 정의하고, 각 액션의 payload 필드가 서로 다르게(예: UPDATE_QTY만 quantity 보유) 좁혀지도록 reducer를 작성해줘. 파일: cartReducer.tsx", "input": "", "output": "export interface CartItem {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  price: number;\n  quantity: number;\n}\n\nexport interface CartState {\n  items: CartItem[];\n}\n\nexport type CartAction =\n  | { type: \"ADD_ITEM\"; item: Omit<CartItem, \"quantity\"> }\n  | { type: \"REMOVE_ITEM\"; id: number }\n  | { type: \"UPDATE_QTY\"; id: number; quantity: number }\n  | { type: \"CLEAR\" };\n\nexport function cartReducer(state: CartState, action: CartAction): CartState {\n  switch (action.type) {\n    case \"ADD_ITEM\": {\n      const existing = state.items.find((i) => i.id === action.item.id);\n      if (existing) {\n        return {\n          items: state.items.map((i) =>\n            i.id === action.item.id ? { ...i, quantity: i.quantity + 1 } : i\n          ),\n        };\n      }\n      return { items: [...state.items, { ...action.item, quantity: 1 }] };\n    }\n    case \"REMOVE_ITEM\":\n      return { items: state.items.filter((i) => i.id !== action.id) };\n    case \"UPDATE_QTY\":\n      return {\n        items: state.items.map((i) =>\n          i.id === action.id ? { ...i, quantity: action.quantity } : i\n        ),\n      };\n    case \"CLEAR\":\n      return { items: [] };\n    default:\n      return state;\n  }\n}\n"}
{"instruction": "제네릭 데이터 패칭 훅 useFetch<T>를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. 상태를 판별 유니온(idle/loading/success/error)으로 모델링하고, success일 때만 data:T가 존재하도록 타입을 좁혀줘. 반환 상태로 분기하면 컴파일러가 data 접근을 안전하게 허용해야 해. 파일: useFetch.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\n\ntype FetchState<T> =\n  | { status: \"idle\" }\n  | { status: \"loading\" }\n  | { status: \"success\"; data: T }\n  | { status: \"error\"; error: Error };\n\nexport function useFetch<T>(url: string): FetchState<T> {\n  const [state, setState] = useState<FetchState<T>>({ status: \"idle\" });\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n    setState({ status: \"loading\" });\n    fetch(url)\n      .then((res) => res.json() as Promise<T>)\n      .then((data) => {\n        if (!cancelled) setState({ status: \"success\", data });\n      })\n      .catch((err: unknown) => {\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setState({ status: \"error\", error: err instanceof Error ? err : new Error(String(err)) });\n        }\n      });\n    return () => {\n      cancelled = true;\n    };\n  }, [url]);\n\n  return state;\n}\n"}
{"instruction": "제네릭 비동기 실행 훅 useAsync<T>를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. 임의의 () => Promise<T> 함수를 받아 실행하고, 상태를 판별 유니온(idle/pending/resolved/rejected)으로 관리하며 run 함수를 반환해줘. resolved에만 value:T가 있어야 해. 파일: useAsync.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import { useState, useCallback } from \"react\";\n\ntype AsyncState<T> =\n  | { status: \"idle\" }\n  | { status: \"pending\" }\n  | { status: \"resolved\"; value: T }\n  | { status: \"rejected\"; reason: Error };\n\ninterface UseAsyncResult<T> {\n  state: AsyncState<T>;\n  run: () => Promise<void>;\n}\n\nexport function useAsync<T>(asyncFn: () => Promise<T>): UseAsyncResult<T> {\n  const [state, setState] = useState<AsyncState<T>>({ status: \"idle\" });\n\n  const run = useCallback(async (): Promise<void> => {\n    setState({ status: \"pending\" });\n    try {\n      const value: T = await asyncFn();\n      setState({ status: \"resolved\", value });\n    } catch (err: unknown) {\n      setState({ status: \"rejected\", reason: err instanceof Error ? err : new Error(String(err)) });\n    }\n  }, [asyncFn]);\n\n  return { state, run };\n}\n"}
{"instruction": "타입 안전한 커스텀 훅 두 개 useToggle과 usePrevious<T>를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. useToggle은 [boolean, () => void, (v: boolean) => void] 튜플을 const 단언으로 반환하고, usePrevious<T>는 이전 렌더의 값을 T | undefined로 반환해줘. 파일: hooks.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import { useState, useRef, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\n\nexport function useToggle(initial: boolean = false): [boolean, () => void, (value: boolean) => void] {\n  const [on, setOn] = useState<boolean>(initial);\n  const toggle = useCallback((): void => setOn((prev) => !prev), []);\n  const set = useCallback((value: boolean): void => setOn(value), []);\n  return [on, toggle, set];\n}\n\nexport function usePrevious<T>(value: T): T | undefined {\n  const ref = useRef<T | undefined>(undefined);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    ref.current = value;\n  }, [value]);\n  return ref.current;\n}\n"}
{"instruction": "드래그 정렬 가능한 리스트 훅 useReorder를 strict TypeScript(.tsx)로 작성해줘. move(from: number, to: number) 처럼 인자 개수가 고정된 콜백들을 정확한 시그니처로 노출하고, 이벤트 핸들러에서 인자 개수를 틀리지 않게(예: 두 개 모두 전달) 호출해줘. 파일: useReorder.tsx", "input": "", "output": "import { useState, useCallback } from \"react\";\n\ninterface UseReorderResult<T> {\n  list: T[];\n  move: (from: number, to: number) => void;\n  reset: (next: T[]) => void;\n}\n\nexport function useReorder<T>(initial: T[]): UseReorderResult<T> {\n  const [list, setList] = useState<T[]>(initial);\n\n  const move = useCallback((from: number, to: number): void => {\n    setList((prev) => {\n      if (from < 0 || to < 0 || from >= prev.length || to >= prev.length) return prev;\n      const next = prev.slice();\n      const [moved] = next.splice(from, 1);\n      next.splice(to, 0, moved);\n      return next;\n    });\n  }, []);\n\n  const reset = useCallback((next: T[]): void => setList(next), []);\n\n  return { list, move, reset };\n}\n\nexport function swapByEvent<T>(reorder: UseReorderResult<T>, from: number, to: number): void {\n  reorder.move(from, to);\n}\n"}
